 s really like to build the technologies shaping the future of aerospace and
  defense. Hear about real-world projects\, innovative technologies\, and ca
 reer pathways directly fromengineers who are making an impact every day. Br
 ing your questions\, make connections\, and get an inside look at where a c
 areer at RTX can take you. Food & Drinks will be served!
