UID:34pl8s56o6bcdd5p9mkb6vrgqb@google.com
CREATED:20230507T154333Z
DESCRIPTION:<span>Tired of emailing code back and forth with your partner? 
  Wish you could save and revert to previous versions of your code without m
 aking a new file every time (actually_final_code.java)?  Git is the solutio
 n to all of your problems.  Learn what git is and how to use it at our inte
 ractive CS 101 workshop.  As with all of our events\, we welcome anyone to 
 attend even if you've never been to an ACM event before. Bring your own com
 puter!</span><br><span> </span><br><span><span>CS101s are ACM's interactive
  lecture series where you'll learn useful industry standard tools that don'
 t get taught in classes. If you've heard about MIT's Missing Semester class
 \, that is what we're emulating here. Our lectures are aimed primarily for 
 freshmen but even experienced developers will learn new things at our sessi
 ons! <span><p>Learn more at:<br><a href="https://texasacm.org/">https://tex
 asacm.org/</a><br><a href="https://instagram.com/texas_acm">https://instagr
 am.com/texas_acm</a><br><a href="https://discord.gg/gVuUcuH">https://discor
 d.gg/gVuUcuH</a></p></span></span></span><span> <br></span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230925T192122Z
LOCATION:GDC 2.410
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:ACM CS101 #3 - Git Gud at git
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
