BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20220202T010000Z
DTEND:20220202T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20261124T200004Z
UID:16je24a3fbjied21ms9s54v008@google.com
CREATED:20211229T195501Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u>Grab a bite to eat and learn about ACM at our
  spring kickoff! Anyone interested in computing is welcome to join our comm
 unity. We hope to see you there!<br><br>About ACM:<br>The Association for C
 omputing Machinery is a UT chapter of the national ACM. We put on social\, 
 academic\, and professional events. ACM is also a community of people enthu
 siastic about any and all aspects of computing. Anyone interested in comput
 ing is welcome to join. It's a great place to make friends or learn from ot
 her students.<br><br>Here are some of our events you can look forward to:<b
 r>Gaming Night: Grab your friends and head up to the 6th floor to play boar
 ds games and video games.<br>CS101: This interactive lecture series teaches
  you useful industry standard tools that don't get taught in classes. We te
 ach you how to use git for class projects\, how to navigate the Linux lab m
 achines\, and other useful development tools.<br>Sponsor Events: Learn abou
 t opportunities at our sponsor companies. This is your chance to ask about 
 company life\, the interview process\, and internship/full time opportuniti
 es.<br>Learn more at:<br><a href="https://texasacm.org/">https://texasacm.o
 rg/</a><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/texas.acm/">https://www
 .facebook.com/groups/texas.acm/</a><br><a href="https://discord.gg/gVuUcuH"
 >https://discord.gg/gVuUcuH</a><u></u></html-blob>
