DESCRIPTION:Join Texas ACM x Bumble's Tech Talk about how Bumble is using A
 I to move faster from planning to implementation while keeping engineers in
  the loop at every stage. We'll talk about how they applied it to a real pr
 oduction feature: what worked\, what didn't\, the guardrails needed\, and w
 here human judgment still had to carry the decision. No fluff\, no pitch fo
 r a product — just the practical version of what was learned.Food is provid
 ed!
