DESCRIPTION:<p>Interviews! Love 'em or hate 'em\, companies won't let you w
 ork for them without 'em. ACM presents thee Interview Workshop\, with tips 
 on the technical and behavioral skills you'll need to get the job. Don't ge
 t blind-sided after career fair! Learn to interview now at our interactive 
 CS101 workshop. <br></p><p><br></p><p>As with all of our events\, we welcom
 e anyone to attend even if you've never been to an ACM event before.<br></p
 ><p><br></p><p>Learn more at:<br><a href="https://texasacm.org/">https://te
 xasacm.org/</a><br><a href="https://instagram.com/texas_acm">https://instag
 ram.com/texas_acm</a><br><a href="https://discord.gg/gVuUcuH">https://disco
 rd.gg/gVuUcuH</a><br></p>
