DESCRIPTION:<span>Grab a snack and learn all about setting up your IDE (vim
 \, VS Code\, IntelliJ\, Eclipse)\, debugging\, tools\, and how to do it all
  efficiently!</span><span></span> <br> <br>CS101s are ACM's interactive lec
 ture series where you'll learn useful industry standard tools that don't ge
 t taught in classes. If you've heard about MIT's Missing Semester class\, t
 hat is what we're emulating here. Our lectures are aimed primarily at fresh
 men but even experienced developers will learn new things at our sessions! 
 <span><p>Learn more at:<br><a href="https://texasacm.org/">https://texasacm
 .org/</a><br><a href="https://instagram.com/texas_acm">https://instagram.co
 m/texas_acm</a><br><a href="https://discord.gg/gVuUcuH">https://discord.gg/
 gVuUcuH</a></p></span>
