CREATED:20241105T052958Z
DESCRIPTION:<b>ACM vs. IEEE Collab: First Inaugural CS vs. ECE Olympics!</b
 ><br>It’s time to bring home the trophy where it belongs—<b>to the EER or t
 he GDC!</b> This first-ever ACM and IEEE collaboration will determine which
  department reigns supreme. This isn’t just a battle\; it’s a quest to clai
 m eternal glory and bring the trophy to its rightful home!<b><br></b><br><b
 r><b>Coding Challenge (30 minutes):</b><ul><li>Form teams of 2-3 participan
 ts and tackle a set of LeetCode problems\, including easy and medium option
 s.</li><li>Score is based on the number of test cases passed—every point co
 unts toward bringing the trophy home!</li></ul><b>Circuit Challenge (30 min
 utes):</b><ul><li>Solve as many circuit problems as you can\, inspired by A
 P Physics.</li><li>Compete to help your department take the lead in this ha
 nds-on challenge!</li></ul>
LAST-MODIFIED:20241105T052958Z
LOCATION:GDC 4.304
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:ACM vs. IEEE Olympics: Coding and Circuit Challenge Session 1
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
