DESCRIPTION:<span>Ah\, graduation.  A time for celebration\, photoshoots\, 
 farewells\, and looking forward.  Before we make the transition into the wo
 rking world\, ACM would like to invite graduates-to-be and their friends to
  reflect upon their values.  We'll be printing a large banner with the ACM 
 Code of Ethics for graduating seniors to sign pledging to uphold the code i
 n their future endeavors.  We welcome seniors and any underclassmen friends
  to celebrate with us.  As with all of our events\, we welcome anyone to at
 tend even if you've never been to an ACM event before.</span>
