UID:2asn6a8qrhib6a0fd322qldsl7@google.com
CREATED:20230507T152046Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Grab a bite to eat and learn about ACM at our fall kickoff! 
 Anyone interested in computing is welcome to join our community. We hope to
  see you there!<br></p><p>About ACM:<br>The Association for Computing Machi
 nery is a UT chapter of the national ACM. We put on social\, academic\, and
  professional events. ACM is also a community of people enthusiastic about 
 any and all aspects of computing. Anyone interested in computing is welcome
  to join. It's a great place to make friends or learn from other students!<
 br></p><p>Here are some of our upcoming events!<br></p><p><b>Freshman Ice C
 ream Socia</b>l: Make new friends or catch up with old ones at our ice crea
 m social!  We welcome anyone who's interested in getting involved in ACM to
  come and hang out.<br><b>CS101</b>: This interactive lecture series teache
 s you useful industry standard tools that don't get taught in classes. We t
 each you how to use git for class projects\, how to navigate the Linux lab 
 machines\, and other useful development tools!<br><b>Hack Night</b>: Work o
 n personal projects every other week and make friends along the way. Think 
 of these events as mini hackathons--we provide the food and event space (an
 d prizes!) and you bring the project ideas.<br><span><b>Mentorship Program<
 /b>: Network with other CS majors in your first year in UTCS and get guidan
 ce on the ins and outs of CS culture. Mentors get a chance to give back to 
 the community and meet new people at our fun events.</span><br><b>Corporate
  Events</b>: Learn about internship opportunities at our sponsoring compani
 es! This is your chance to network\, ask about company life\, the interview
  process\, and internship/full time opportunities.<br></p><p><br>Learn more
  at:<br><a href="https://texasacm.org/">https://texasacm.org/</a><br><a hre
 f="https://instagram.com/texas_acm">https://instagram.com/texas_acm</a><br>
 <a href="https://discord.gg/gVuUcuH">https://discord.gg/gVuUcuH</a><br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230808T144225Z
LOCATION:GDC 2.216
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:ACM Fall Kickoff
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
