UID:7q4dfaei5s1p271euaq25j0k7f@google.com
CREATED:20211229T205104Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><u></u><u></u>Ah\, graduation.&nbsp\; A time 
 for celebration\, photoshoots\, farewells\, and signing your soul over to <
 a href="https://www.sfgate.com/tech/article/Mark-Zuckerberg-suspected-lizar
 d-person-8204111.php">lizard people</a>.&nbsp\; Before we make the transiti
 on into the working world\, ACM would like to invite graduates-to-be and th
 eir friends to reflect upon their values.&nbsp\; We'll be printing a large 
 banner with the ACM Code of Ethics for graduating seniors to sign pledging 
 to uphold the code in their future endeavors.&nbsp\; We welcome seniors and
  any underclassmen friends to celebrate with us.&nbsp\; As with all of our 
 events\, we welcome anyone to attend even if you've never been to an ACM ev
 ent before.<u></u><br><u></u><br>Learn more at:<br><a href="https://texasac
 m.org/">https://texasacm.org/</a><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/grou
 ps/texas.acm/">https://www.facebook.com/groups/texas.acm/</a><br><a href="h
 ttps://discord.gg/gVuUcuH">https://discord.gg/gVuUcuH</a><u></u><u></u><u><
 /u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230121T101005Z
LOCATION:GDC Atrium
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Senior Sendoff
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
