CREATED:20150810T170756Z
DESCRIPTION:Do we like board games? Yeah\, we like board games. So make sur
 e you bring all your favorites while we snack and play until we either drop
  or drop each other (Shadow Hunters\, anyone?). This event isn't as big as 
 LAN party and is definitely (well\, slightly) more relaxed\, but you still 
 get +3 officer points for going and cheese puffs are great\, so hopefully y
 ou'll all go! Watch out for the Facebook event to RSVP to so we can make su
 re we get enough snacks.\n\nPrices:\nPaid member -- FREE\nNon-member -- $5\
 nNon-member that becomes a member that night -- $20 (your dues) and then FR
 EE\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20150810T170947Z
