CREATED:20180507T232520Z
DESCRIPTION:Come put your programming skills to the test! Whether you're ju
 st a beginner in 312 or you're a senior in your final semester there are qu
 estions for you! As always\, there will be free food!\n\nIn UT programming 
 competitions\, there are 5-7 problems. Each problem requires competitors to
  submit a program that can solve the problem. The winner is the person who 
 has solved the most problems. If multiple people have solved the same numbe
 r of problems\, the tiebreaker is the sum of the times it took to solve eac
 h problem\, in minutes. The top competitors win both great prizes and recog
 nition from Citadel Securities!
LAST-MODIFIED:20190304T143826Z
LOCATION:GDC 1.304
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Programming Competition
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
