DESCRIPTION:<p>Get some boba and learn about DISCO's internship and new gra
 d&nbsp\;opportunities.&nbsp\;Join DISCO engineers to discuss how they're us
 ing BERT (state of the art NLP algorithms)&nbsp\;to analyze documents to fi
 nd insights&nbsp\;in some of the most important legal cases\,&nbsp\;how the
 y manage search and ingest terrabytes of documents\, and lots more exicitin
 g&nbsp\;technology they put to use.</p><p>Like all Texas ACM events\, we en
 courage you to show up\, whether this is your first event of ours or you're
  a long time attendee! Texas ACM hosts events all semester\, open to all UT
  students\, to build community and career support in computer science.</p>
