 \, a UX/ Swift engineer at Apple and professional model\; Keele Clendenin\,
  an Apple engineer working on connecting apps like Apple TV and Apple Maps 
 to billions of users\; and Lauren Jernigan\, a Microsoft engineer working o
 n Azure networking to keep customers connected to Microsoft devices. Boba w
 ill be provided!</blockquote>
