DESCRIPTION:<span id="docs-internal-guid-424dd1c1-e35c-b6fc-9955-534f5f005f
 03"><span style="font-size: 10pt\; font-family: Arial\; color: rgb(0\, 0\, 
 0)\; background-color: transparent\; font-variant-numeric: normal\; font-va
 riant-east-asian: normal\; vertical-align: baseline\; white-space: pre-wrap
 \;">Wondering what new events are coming up? Wondering how to become more i
 nvolved in ACM? Just want to come spend time with your best friends? You ca
