DESCRIPTION:\nGrab a bite to eat\, shirt to wear\, and learn about ACM at o
 ur fall kickoff! Anyone interested in computing is welcome to join our comm
 unity. We hope to see you there! About ACM: The Association for Computing M
 achinery is a UT chapter of the national ACM. We put on social\, academic\,
  and professional events. ACM is also a community of people enthusiastic ab
 out any and all aspects of computing. Anyone interested in computing is wel
 come to join. It&#39\;s a great place to make friends or learn from other s
 tudents!
LAST-MODIFIED:20260901T194130Z
LOCATION:GDC 2.216
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Texas ACM Fall Kickoff
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
