DESCRIPTION:S’mores galore! Come join us for our biggest event of the semes
 ter! Take a break from the craziness of the city to enjoy the tranquility o
 f the great outdoors with some of your great friends! There will be differe
 nt activities ranging from sports\, to swimming\, to cooking s'mores over a
  campfire\, and anything in between.\n\nPlease sign up here: TexasACM.org/f
 orms/Retreat\nNOTE: You must go to the general meeting on March 26 (the wee
 k after spring break) if you're planning to go to retreat! Email social@tex
 asacm.org if you have a conflict.\n\nThis event has a $6 entry fee. This ca
 n be paid through Venmo or to an officer before or at the event.
LAST-MODIFIED:20190306T001900Z
LOCATION:McKinney Falls State Park\, 5808 McKinney Falls Pkwy\, Austin\, TX
  78744\, USA
