 ting off for an embarrassingly long time (e.g. submitting job applications\
 , learning 4 weeks of content the day of your exam\, technical interview pr
 ep\, the list goes on!!)?? ACM has the solution for you: come to our anti-p
 rocrastination cafe\, held on the 5th floor bridge. Write down up to three 
 goals you would like to achieve today\, grab a cup of coffee or tea or othe
 r warm beverage\, and get some work done under the accountability-enforcing
  eyes of our officers.<br> <br><span><span>Learn more at:<br><a href="https
 ://texasacm.org/">https://texasacm.org/</a><br><a href="https://instagram.c
 om/texas_acm">https://instagram.com/texas_acm</a><br><a href="https://disco
 rd.gg/gVuUcuH">https://discord.gg/gVuUcuH</a></span></span></span>
