CREATED:20150810T170756Z
DESCRIPTION:Spiceworks has swooped in to save the day\, so never fear! This
  event will continue to be sponsored!\n\nCome join all your friends in the 
 GDC faculty lounge to play your favorite video games on your favorite conso
 le from dusk until dawn. Bring your monitors\, towers\, Xboxs\, PS3s\, game
 s\, whatever you want. If you want to play it\, bring it\, and there's boun
 d to be someone that will play it with you. Spiceworks will be sponsoring p
 izza\, snacks\, sodas\, and prizes for a gaming competition to be held some
 time that night (game to be determined so I'm open to suggestions\; the mor
 e horrible the game\, the better)\, so come play games with some of the dev
 elopers and all your closest friends for 12 glorious hours.\n\nPrices:\nPai
 d member -- FREE (because SpiceRex and Spiceworks)\nNon-member -- $10\nNon-
 member that becomes a member that night -- $20 (your dues) and then FREE\nI
 t's gonna be awesome\, so be there (and you get +5 officer points for atten
 ding!).
