DESCRIPTION:Come join us for our first Lecture Series of this year where Dr
 . Van De Gejin will be presenting "Weapons of Math Induction for the War on
  Error". He will discuss how goal-oriented programming\, as advocated by Di
 jkstra\, helps us deliver high-performance linear algebra libraries to the 
 scientific computing community. Make sure to come out if you enjoy learning
  about these fascinating topics! We'll also have Tiff's treats and milk to 
 keep your mind fueled while you listen to the talk!
