DESCRIPTION:For those of you who have never been to Big Event\, it is essen
 tially an evening of outdoor fun at Eastwood Park\, where you can play Fris
 bee\, hit your best friends with foam swords\, and do other park-related ac
 tivities. Weâll play for awhile\, then eat some free Zen together and fin
 ish the evening up with some (mostly) CS-related trivia. Hereâs the fun p
 art:  we encourage all of you to invite your professors to this event. Itâ
 s always fun to play trivia against Mike Scott (you wonât win) and to se
 e the minds of Novak and Peterson collide\, but those things canât happen
  if you donât invite them! So start asking your professors now and bribe 
 them with the prospect of free food. It will make for quite the fun time. T
 his event is +5 points as well\, so make sure you sign in before you go ins
 ane on those foam swords.
LAST-MODIFIED:20150810T170947Z
LOCATION:Eastwood Park\, 3001 Harris Park Ave. Austin\, TX 78705
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Big Event
TRANSP:OPAQUE
