DESCRIPTION:Tired of emailing code back and forth with your partner?  Wish 
 you could save and revert to previous versions of your code without making 
 a new file every time (actually_final_code.java)?  Git is the solution to a
 ll of your problems.  Learn what git is and how to use it at our interactiv
 e CS 101 workshop.  As with all of our events\, we welcome anyone to attend
  even if you've never been to an ACM event before. Bring your own computer!
