DESCRIPTION:Do you have any large and stressful tasks you've been putting o
 ff for an embarrassingly long time (e.g. submitting job applications\, lear
 ning 4 weeks of content two days before your exam\, technical interview pre
 p\, the list goes on!!)?? ACM has the solution for you: come to our anti-pr
 ocrastination cafe\, held in our org office. Write down up to three goals y
 ou would like to achieve today\, grab a cup of coffee or tea or other warm 
 beverage\, and get some work done under the accountability-enforcing eyes o
 f our officers.<br> <br><span><span>Learn more at:<br><a href="https://texa
 sacm.org/">https://texasacm.org/</a><br><a href="https://instagram.com/texa
 s_acm">https://instagram.com/texas_acm</a><br><a href="https://discord.gg/g
 VuUcuH">https://discord.gg/gVuUcuH</a></span></span>
