CREATED:20230830T155540Z
DESCRIPTION:<span>Operational Officers\, OOs for short\, are junior ACM off
 icers that shadow senior officers to assist them and learn about the positi
 on.  Becoming an OO is a great way to jump start your involvement in ACM.</
 span><br><span> </span><span> </span><br><span>It's also a fun way to try o
 ut a leadership position in a student org.  Learn more about the positions 
 here: </span><a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Ppniq1sr3pbxoVGy6
 m2MhE3HvsI9pm5KTnqar5nUSUs/edit?usp=sharing">OO Position Descriptions 2023-
 2024</a><br> <br><span>Apply here: </span><a href="https://forms.gle/kviLfW
 Wzo3NBzAj87">https://forms.gle/kviLfWWzo3NBzAj87</a>. Due 11:59pm!<br> <br>
 Interviews will take place the week of October 2 and results will be announ
 ced by October 11. We look forward to working together!
LAST-MODIFIED:20230830T155934Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:ACM Operational Officer Applications Due
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
ATTACH;FILENAME=OO Position Descriptions 2023-2024;FMTTYPE=application/vnd.
 google-apps.document:https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Ppniq1sr3pbxoVGy6m
 2MhE3HvsI9pm5KTnqar5nUSUs/edit?usp=sharing
