CREATED:20150810T170756Z
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate Google's birthday this Friday\, 9/27\, from 12-2
 pm in the GDC Atrium with cupcakes from Polkadots! Join the G+ event and po
 st pictures with your cupcakes and Google swag with the hashtag #UTGoogle15
  to be entered into a drawing for swag and Google Play gift cards! Share th
 e event with the same hashtag for extra chances to win.\n\nYour UT Austin G
 oogle Student Ambassadors\, Connie and Elynn\, will be drawing names every 
 so often and giving out prizes for super awesome and creative photos. They'
 ll also be there to answer questions regarding opportunities at Google and 
 hand out more swag.\n\nInvite your friends and share this with your fellow 
 Longhorns! Everyone is welcome to come and celebrate with us. Have a Google
 y day and see you on Friday!
LAST-MODIFIED:20150810T170947Z
LOCATION:GDC Atrium
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Happy 15th Birthday\, Google!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
