 kh (Programming for Performance and Correctness)</span><br><span>- Dr. Davi
 d Zuckerman (Randomized Algorithms)</span><br><span>- Dr. Karen Landolt (Be
 havioral Ethics)</span><br><span>- Dr. Hovav Shacham's TA (Network Security
