CREATED:20230725T014220Z
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever wondered about your career options besides workin
 g in industry? If so\, we have a panel full of grad students who are "grad"
  to meet you!<br> <br>Join us in our friendly panel to ask grad students al
 l your burning questions about their experiences applying to grad school an
 d the reasons they chose grad school. In the second half of the event\, we'
 ll be hosting a mixer with drinks and snacks so you can ask more specific q
 uestions and form some personal connections.<br> <br><span><span>Learn more
  at:<br><a href="https://texasacm.org/">https://texasacm.org/</a><br><a hre
 f="https://instagram.com/texas_acm">https://instagram.com/texas_acm</a><br>
 <a href="https://discord.gg/gVuUcuH">https://discord.gg/gVuUcuH</a></span><
 /span>
