DESCRIPTION:Grab a bite to eat and learn about ACM at our fall kickoff! Any
 one interested in computing is welcome to join our community. We hope to se
 e you there!\n\nAbout ACM:The Association for Computing Machinery is a UT c
 hapter of the national ACM. We put on social\, academic\, and professional 
 events. ACM is also a community of people enthusiastic about any and all as
 pects of computing. Anyone interested in computing is welcome to join. It's
  a great place to make friends or learn from other students!
