CREATED:20190901T230408Z
DESCRIPTION:Come on out to network with recruiters from EOG Resources.\n\nW
 ork on real projects that go into real production. Past intern projects ran
 ge from utilizing machine learning to analyze footage from drones flying ov
 er facilities to quickly detect gas leaks\, all the way to: routing the del
 ivery of millions of dollars worth of natural gas dynamically through thous
 ands of miles of pipeline. Take ownership of your project and make somethin
 g real.\n\nOh\, and they take sophomores as interns.\n\nFREE FOOD (Torchy's
 !)
LAST-MODIFIED:20190917T201241Z
LOCATION:GDC 5.302
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:EOG Resources Recruiting Event
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
