 the classes you want\, but we can help you decide which classes you end up 
 waitlisted for.  At CS 411 professors talk about the classes they teach\, s
 o you can decide if you're interested in the content and ask questions befo
 re you register for the class.&nbsp\;As with all of our events\, we welcome
  anyone to attend even if you've never been to an ACM event before.<br><br>
 Learn more at:<br><a href="https://texasacm.org/">https://texasacm.org/</a>
 <br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/texas.acm/">https://www.facebo
 ok.com/groups/texas.acm/</a><br><a href="https://discord.gg/gVuUcuH">https:
 //discord.gg/gVuUcuH</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230121T100917Z
LOCATION:GDC 4.302
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:So You Want To Take CS Upper Division Electives
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
