UID:0rikonaksvb3f6mii97s8afask@google.com
CREATED:20171128T000315Z
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for our last Lecture Series of this year where Dr.
  Huele will be presenting "Solving very hard problems: Cube-and-Conquer\, a
  hybrid SAT solving method". He will discuss how SAT has enabled us to dete
 rmine the correctness of complex systems and answering long-standing open q
 uestions in mathematics. In addition\, he will also show that through the c
 ombination of automated tools and supercomputing\, it allow us to solve hug
 e problems. This technology itself can be used to verify security and safet
 y problems in critical systems. Make sure to come out if you enjoy learning
  about these fascinating topics! We'll also have Tiff's treats and milk to 
 keep your mind fueled while you listen to the talk!
LAST-MODIFIED:20171128T000331Z
LOCATION:GDC 2.216
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Lecture Series - Dr. Heule
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
