CREATED:20250401T200819Z
DESCRIPTION:How often do CS majors touch grass? What is our favorite progra
 mming language and why is it Rust? All of your burning questions about CS m
 ajors will be answered tonight! Students and professors will face off\, Fam
 ily Feud-style\, to celebrate the end of CS Week and distribute prizes. Our
  all-star panel of professors includes Devangi Parikh\, Amrita Kaur\, Etien
 ne Vouga\, Ahmed Gheith\, and Alison Norman! Eat pizza\, cheer (or jeer) fo
 r professors\, and play along! Follow us on Instagram (@utcsweek) for more 
 info!
LAST-MODIFIED:20250401T200844Z
LOCATION:GDC 2.216
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:CS Week: Family Feud with ACM
TRANSP:OPAQUE
